              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini hormaata isani d'owe, badiini isaniti d'ufa. Isani ch'ufti woraanaafi yokhaani d'ukubaani raawattani, nama tokole ka hafe d'abani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo isani nami takeeni iraa hafe lafa Misiri keesaa lafa Yudati deebia. Duuba akanaani jari hafe suni dubbi tiyyafi ta worra, ta d'ugaa taate, gargari beekha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini, AABBO Waaqi, lafa tana keesati isani gaargalche; duuba akanaani aka dubbini, Anini isani balleese jed'e taani guutamtu beetani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.29"
            ]
          }
        },
